<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>开场 · 立问题</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>那 AI 写的改动，走的是同一条路吗</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 56, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}></Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>人的改动</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>AI 的改动</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 88, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>谁批</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>有审批流</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>谁签的字？</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 88, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>在哪个环境跑</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>有环境隔离</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>它在哪台机器上跑？</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 88, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>留下什么记录</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>有审计日志</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>它每一步记下来了吗？</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 24}}>三个问号，不是三个反问——是三个现在没人答得上来的问题。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>03 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
